 Surfaces are strictly flat. Depth is created through crisp 1px borders, tonal contrast, and extremely subtle radial glows, rather than drop shadows.
 
 ### Shadow Vocabulary
+
 - **Zero Shadow:** The default state for all cards and inputs.
